      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "最后丈夫只好："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Yesterday my husband removed the gate"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 46,
      "start": 275.526,
      "end": 280.822,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "Rex 的反应是："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Rex got so annoyed we have not seen him since"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 47,
      "start": 281.171,
      "end": 286.331,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "这个结尾是漫画式的生气和消失，不是危险或悲伤。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 48,
      "start": 286.681,
      "end": 293.681,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第四帧记住：Rex 把一个开门技巧玩成了 in-and-out barking habit。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 49,
      "start": 294.031,
      "end": 298.652,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "老师，Rex 学会按 latch 以后，训练算成功了吗？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 50,
      "start": 299.002,
      "end": 303.362,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "算成功了。The trick worked. 它真的会自己开门了。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 51,
      "start": 303.712,
      "end": 306.79,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "那为什么家里还是头疼？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 52,
      "start": 307.14,
      "end": 314.064,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "因为真正的目标不是"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "open the gate"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "，而是"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "stop barking"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 53,
      "start": 314.413,
      "end": 317.873,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "哦，办法解决了 in，却没有解决 barking。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 54,
      "start": 318.223,
      "end": 322.823,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "对。后来 Rex 还把这个办法变成了新的 out problem。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 55,
      "start": 323.173,
      "end": 329.085,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Let himself in"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "和"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "let him out"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "怎么分？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 56,
      "start": 329.435,
      "end": 339.371,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Let himself in"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "是 Rex 自己把自己放进来；"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "let him out"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "是别人把 Rex 放出去。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 57,
      "start": 339.721,
      "end": 346.064,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "所以标题"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "In or out?"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "就是在笑这个方向反复变？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 58,
      "start": 346.414,
      "end": 351.614,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "Exactly. Rex learned one clever trick, then turned it into an annoying habit."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 59,
      "start": 351.963,
      "end": 356.211,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Our dog, Rex, used to sit outside our front gate and bark."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 60,
      "start": 356.561,
      "end": 361.697,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Every time he wanted to come into the garden he would bark until someone opened the gate."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 61,
      "start": 362.047,
      "end": 368.911,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "As the neighbours complained of the noise, my husband spent weeks training him to press his paw on the latch to let himself in."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 62,
      "start": 369.261,
      "end": 372.885,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Rex soon became an expert at opening the gate."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 63,
      "start": 373.235,
      "end": 378.635,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "However, when I was going out shopping last week, I noticed him in the garden near the gate."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 64,
      "start": 378.985,
      "end": 382.969,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "This time he was barking so that someone would let him out!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 65,
      "start": 383.319,
      "end": 387.039,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Since then, he has developed another bad habit."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 66,
      "start": 387.389,
      "end": 393.341,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "As soon as he opens the gate from the outside, he comes into the garden and waits until the gate shuts."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 67,
      "start": 393.69,
      "end": 397.242,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Then he sits and barks until someone lets him out."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 68,
      "start": 397.592,
      "end": 402.2,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "After this he immediately lets himself in and begins barking again."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 69,
      "start": 402.55,
      "end": 407.782,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Yesterday my husband removed the gate and Rex got so annoyed we have not seen him since."
        }
      ]
    },
